00:58:38.130 --> 00:58:44.610
<v Marguerite Oswald>I am in 26 volumes of the president's report which is all over the world.
<v Marguerite Oswald>我身处总统报告的26卷里，这些报告遍布世界各地。

00:58:44.610 --> 00:58:56.230
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week with more stories of This American Life.
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周带着更多《美国生活》的故事回来。

